  "id": "youssef-harby/geoparquet-overviews",
  "title": "geoparquet-overviews",
  "description": "A reference/demo dataset for the \"geoparquet-overviews\" draft convention, which embeds a simplified overview geometry alongside full-resolution geometry in a single GeoParquet file so it renders instantly in a web map while remaining fully queryable by a SQL engine. It packages example conversions of Finnish topographic (MTK) building/terrain features and Overture Maps building footprints for Tokyo across multiple convention versions (root, v0.1.0, v0.2.0).",
